    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>The Dog Wash is a self-service dog washing station attached to a car wash, in the Pradeaux retail park in Saint-Cyr-sur-Mer, between Bandol and La Ciotat. The idea: all the equipment (hot water, shampoo, drying) is available for washing your dog yourself, no appointment needed.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The big advantage of this type of station is availability: open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, all year round, confirmed by the Saint-Cyr-sur-Mer tourist office (a near-official local source) in addition to several business directories. That makes it a handy option after a day at the beach or a walk in the area, without having to fit in a slot with a groomer. The exact price of a wash isn't mentioned by any source, including the tourist office — worth checking on site.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: since it's in a retail park (ZAC des Pradeaux), plan to drive there rather than walk — it isn't a pedestrian area.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Saint-Cyr-sur-Mer and its Lecques beach are a few minutes away, as is Bandol. Handy for rinsing off your dog before hitting the road towards the Côte d'Azur or Marseille.</p>
